¬import il from "../../../../../_shared/variables/imageLinks"


#### Command palette

1. Press `Ctrl+Shift+P` to open the Command Palette.

2. The Command Palette appears. *- red rectangle*


##### Format whole document

Formats the entire active file.

2. Type `Format Document` and select the command **Format Document**. *- orange rectangle*

{{::il.Vscode_CommandFormatTextDocument_img}}


##### Format highlighted selection

Formats the block of text you have selected

2. Type `![alt text](image.png)` and select the command **Format Selection**. *- orange rectangle*

{{::il.Vscode_CommandFormatTextSelection_img}}

